    <node id="SMOKEFREE.GOV">
      <data key="d0">SMOKEFREE.GOV</data>
      <data key="d1">SMOKEFREE.GOV</data>
      <data key="d2">endpoint</data>
      <data key="d3">SMOKEFREE.GOV is an online quit-smoking resource and support website recommended to help people stop smoking or vaping. It is specifically designed as a smoking-cessation tool, offering support and guidance for individuals who smoke or vape and want to quit. The resource is frequently referenced as a trusted online destination for those seeking help to overcome nicotine addiction, providing accessible information and encouragement to support users through the quitting process.
Relationships:
  - Source: SMOKEFREE.GOV
  - Target: SMOKING
  - Description: SmokeFree.gov is designed for people who smoke and want support quitting
  - Source: SMOKEFREE.GOV
