    <node id="BETOBACCOFREE.GOV">
      <data key="d0">BETOBACCOFREE.GOV</data>
      <data key="d1">BETOBACCOFREE.GOV</data>
      <data key="d2">endpoint</data>
      <data key="d3">BeTobaccoFree.gov is an online, tobacco-cessation support resource specifically recommended in the provided text to help individuals quit tobacco use. It serves as a comprehensive support website for people seeking to stop smoking, vaping, or using tobacco in any form. The resource is positioned as a reliable quit-smoking aid that offers guidance and support to those who want to overcome nicotine dependence. It is recommended as a support website for quitting tobacco, and is also highlighted as an online resource for finding help with tobacco cessation. Additionally, it is described as a support tool for people who smoke or vape, providing access to assistance for quitting. Overall, BeTobaccoFree.gov functions as a recommended, accessible online destination for anyone looking for help to end their tobacco or vaping habits.
