    <node id="CDC.GOV/TOBACCO">
      <data key="d0">CDC.GOV/TOBACCO</data>
      <data key="d1">CDC.GOV/TOBACCO</data>
      <data key="d2">endpoint</data>
      <data key="d3">CDC.GOV/TOBACCO is the official tobacco-related online resource of the U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC). It serves as a comprehensive tobacco cessation website, specifically designed to help individuals quit smoking and access a wide range of tobacco-related resources. Recommended as a reliable online support tool, the site provides guidance for those looking to stop smoking or vaping. It is frequently cited as a quit-smoking resource and a valuable source of information for tobacco prevention and cessation.
