    <node id="SYSTEMATIC EXAMINATION">
      <data key="d0">SYSTEMATIC EXAMINATION</data>
      <data key="d1">SYSTEMATIC EXAMINATION</data>
      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">: The provider listens to the lungs and heart, looks in the eyes, ears, nose, and throat, and feels and applies pressure to parts of the body to assess whether organs are of normal size, soft or hard, or cause pain when touched [Data: Entities (163); Sources (134, 73, 120)].
</data>
