    <node id="LYMPH NODE ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d0">LYMPH NODE ASSESSMENT</data>
      <data key="d1">LYMPH NODE ASSESSMENT</data>
      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">: The provider feels for enlarged lymph nodes in the neck, underarm, and groin. This is particularly important in conditions like CLL where cancer cells can build up in lymph nodes, the spleen, and the liver, causing them to swell [Data: Entities (163); Sources (30, 134, 73, 120)].
</data>
    </node>
