      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">: Depending on the clinical context, the physical exam may include examination of the breasts, spleen, or liver, and may involve palpation of the oral cavity or use of a mirror or fiberoptic scope to visualize hard-to-see areas [Data: Entities (163)].
</data>
    </node>
