  - Target: BURKITT LEUKEMIA
  - Description: Burkitt leukemia, also known as mature B-cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia (ALL), is a rare subtype of acute lymphoblastic leukemia. It is a distinct form of the disease, categorized under the broader entity of acute lymphoblastic leukemia, and is recognized for its mature B-cell phenotype.</data>
