  - Description: The patient may be recommended for germline testing based on family history and risk factors.
  - Source: DOCTOR
  - Target: GERMLINE TESTING
  - Description: A doctor might suggest genetic germline testing if family history suggests inherited cancer risk.
  - Source: BLADDER CANCER
  - Target: GERMLINE TESTING
  - Description: Bladder cancer is an indication that germline testing may be appropriate, and germline mutations are found in bladder cancer
  - Source: GERMLINE TESTING
