      <data key="d3">A bone cancer characterized by fusions of the EWS gene (EWSR1) on chromosome 22 with members of the ETS gene family, most commonly FLI1; almost all cases have one of these gene fusions, which arise from somatic mutations, not inherited changes.
Relationships:
  - Source: SOMATIC MUTATION
