  - Description: Ewing sarcoma is a type of bone cancer.
  - Source: TRANSLOCATION
  - Target: EWING SARCOMA
  - Description: Ewing sarcoma is associated with translocations, including t(11;22).
  - Source: GENE FUSION
  - Target: EWING SARCOMA
  - Description: Ewing sarcoma is characterized by fusions of EWSR1 with ETS family genes such as FLI1.</data>
