      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">In leukemia, imaging tests such as CT, MRI, and PET scans are used to look for leukemia outside the bone marrow, as well as areas of infection or bleeding.</data>
      <data key="d12">IMAGING TESTS</data>
    </edge>
