      <data key="d11">Stopping smoking or vaping is essential to maximize the chance of cure and minimize side effects from cancer treatment; SmokeFree.gov is an online resource to help quit.</data>
      <data key="d12">SMOKEFREE.GOV</data>
    </edge>
