      <data key="d11">Immunotherapy is a form of treatment that can cause side effects such as fatigue, fever, nausea, and infection. Supportive care is used to help relieve these side effects associated with immunotherapy. It provides essential management to reduce discomfort and improve the patient's experience during treatment.</data>
