      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">Endometrial biopsy may be part of the initial pelvic exam when ovarian cancer is suspected, and can rule out uterine cancer instead.</data>
      <data key="d12">OVARIAN CANCER</data>
    </edge>
