      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">Dr. [Doctor] provides ongoing care for the patient, including performing skin exams as part of their medical treatment. The patient, in turn, actively participates in their care by asking the doctor to review their pathology report. Together, these interactions reflect a collaborative doctor-patient relationship focused on evaluation, diagnosis, and informed treatment decisions.</data>
